    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d900">

                <pb facs="0821" n="705" xml:id="pg705"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 850a.001M33.</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Acting Secretary of State to the American Chargé
                        d’Affaires</hi>.</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Department of State</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1912-09-28">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">September 28, 1912</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>
                    <hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: I inclose, with office copy, a
                        letter<anchor n="1" xml:id="d900-f1"/> addressed by the President to Her
                    Royal Highness, Marie Adelaide, acknowledging the letter of June 18 last, by
                    which Her Royal Highness announced that, having attained her majority, she had
                    taken possession of the Sovereign Power of the Grand Duchy of Luxemburg.</p>
                <p>You will forward the copy to the Foreign Office of Luxemburg and deliver the
                    original in the manner most agreeable to Her Royal Highness.</p>
                <p>I am [etc.]</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Alvey A. Adee.</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
